TYPE ERROR: `sneaky` reaches "/etc/shadow" where only p is admitted, an authority the caller chooses; perform the operation on the named argument, or widen the declared row to the label bare
TYPE ERROR: `rooted` reaches "/*" where only p is admitted, an authority the caller chooses; perform the operation on the named argument, or widen the declared row to the label bare
TYPE ERROR: `extended` reaches the whole domain where only p is admitted, an authority the caller chooses; an extension of it is the whole domain, so declare `p` pattern-ranging, `(p : String @FileRead*)` or `(p : Authority FileRead*)`
